{
    "title": "LCD simple",
    "description": "A free fashionable LCD type watch face!\r\n\r\nOnly available on Wear OS 3+ (API 30+) devices\r\n\r\nFeatures:\r\n\r\n- LCD series\r\n- Sunset\r\n- power\r\n- digital time\r\n- Week\r\n\r\nInstallation options:\r\n1. Keep the watch connected to your phone.\r\n\r\n2. Install into your phone. Once installed, immediately press and hold the display to check the list of watch faces in your watch, then swipe to the end and click Add Watch Face. There you can see your newly installed watch face and activate it.\r\n\r\n3. After the installation is complete, you can also check the following:\r\n\r\nA: For Samsung watches, check the Galaxy Wearable app on your phone (install it if you haven't already). Under Watch Faces > Downloaded, you can see your newly installed watch face and apply it to your connected watch.\r\n\r\nB. For other smart watch brands, for other Wear OS devices, please check the watch app installed in your smart watch brand phone and find the newly installed watch face in the watch face gallery or list.\r\n\r\n4. Also visit the link below which shows many options on how to install a Wear OS watch face in your watch.\r\nhttps://developer.samsung.com/sdp/blog/en-us/2022/11/15/install-watch-faces-for-galaxy-watch5-and-one-ui-watch-45",
    "descriptionHTML": "A free fashionable LCD type watch face!<br><br>Only available on Wear OS 3+ (API 30+) devices<br><br>Features:<br><br>- LCD series<br>- Sunset<br>- power<br>- digital time<br>- Week<br><br>Installation options:<br>1. Keep the watch connected to your phone.<br><br>2. Install into your phone. Once installed, immediately press and hold the display to check the list of watch faces in your watch, then swipe to the end and click Add Watch Face. There you can see your newly installed watch face and activate it.<br><br>3. After the installation is complete, you can also check the following:<br><br>A: For Samsung watches, check the Galaxy Wearable app on your phone (install it if you haven&#39;t already). Under Watch Faces &gt; Downloaded, you can see your newly installed watch face and apply it to your connected watch.<br><br>B. For other smart watch brands, for other Wear OS devices, please check the watch app installed in your smart watch brand phone and find the newly installed watch face in the watch face gallery or list.<br><br>4. Also visit the link below which shows many options on how to install a Wear OS watch face in your watch.<br>https://developer.samsung.com/sdp/blog/en-us/2022/11/15/install-watch-faces-for-galaxy-watch5-and-one-ui-watch-45",
